    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "PVTGs Identification: Frequently tested PVTGs in AP are Chenchu, Gadaba, Dongria Khond, Kutia Khond, Kolam, Konda Reddi, and Thoti.",
        "AP Land Transfer Regulation 1 of 1970 (Act 1/70): Prohibits the transfer of immovable property in Scheduled Areas to non-tribals.",
        "Rampa Rebellion (1922-24): Focus on Alluri Sitarama Raju's leadership and the opposition to the Madras Forest Act of 1882."
      ],
      "id": "84gi54z"
